  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.4.4: Production-hardening release focused on consumer stability and maintainability. Core updates include bounded consumption dispatch queue with backpressure (CreateBounded + FullMode.Wait + async enqueue), graceful shutdown convergence for post-consume lifecycle draining, Lite Push subscription flow cleanup via manager-based responsibility split, and OffsetOption protobuf conversion extraction into reusable helper. Also consolidates protobuf layout under RocketMQ.Client/protos and aligns package metadata/repository links to the rocketmq-client-dotnet repository.",
